  "description": "Savills is proud to present The Ironworks, a brand-new rental development located in Dundrum Town, Dublin’s premier destination for shopping, dining, culture, and lifestyle.\r\n \r\nThese beautifully designed homes offer the perfect blend of style and convenience, right in the heart of where everything is happening.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n•\tProperty options: Choose from a selection of stylish Studio, 1-bedroom, and 2-bedroom \r\n        apartments.\r\n•\tOnsite amenities: Enjoy a host of premium amenities including concierge services, a cardio gym,\r\n        resident lounge, co-working space, MyPup parcel lockers, a spectacular rooftop garden, a private\r\n        courtyard, and a dedicated private dining area.\r\n•\tUnbeatable location: Perfectly positioned in Dundrum Town one of Ireland’s largest and most \r\n        popular retail and leisure destinations. With over 100 shops, restaurants, cafés, a cinema, a \r\n        theatre, and green open spaces nearby — everything you need is just moments from your door.\r\n\r\nProperty Specifications:\r\n\r\n•\tInterior design: Each apartment is fully furnished with high-quality, bespoke furniture packs from\r\n        Hyde Interiors, featuring contemporary finishes throughout.\r\n•\tModern kitchen: Sleek, custom-designed kitchens fitted with premium appliances.\r\n•\tLuxury bathrooms: Main and ensuite bathrooms with elegant, high-spec fittings.\r\n•\tOutdoor Space: Enjoy your own private outdoor retreat with either a spacious balcony or a glazed\r\n         winter garden. \r\n•\tParking & storage: Secure underground car parking and dedicated bicycle storage available.\r\n•\tEnergy efficiency: All units are A2–A3 BER rated and the development operates fully electric, \r\n        ensuring excellent energy efficiency, lower emissions and long term comfort for residents. \r\n\r\nTransport & Connectivity:\r\n\r\nThe Ironworks is superbly connected — just a short walk to the Luas Green Line, with multiple D